				1109,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove redundant ApplicationState re-exports\n\nEliminate the explicit `pub use ApplicationState::*` statement and extra blank lines in `Source/ApplicationState/State/mod.rs`. The module already imports the types directly via `pub mod ApplicationState;`, making the wildcard re-export unnecessary and redundant for backward compatibility.\n\nThis simplification cleans up the module namespace, adheres to Rust idioms by avoiding redundant re-exports, and reduces potential confusion regarding symbol visibility in the core `ApplicationState` container.",
			"SHA": "d820a1af5b83b56f9655d169290065485006f751"
		}
